OL,3,GNEWSARobber's danger pursuit after
OL,4,Aknifepoint car theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FA robber who led police on a
OL,7,Flife-threatening pursuit in a car he
OL,8,Fhad stolen at knifepoint has been
OL,9,Fjailed for more than seven years.
OL,11,FThomas Lacson, 29, threatened to stab a
OL,12,Fcouple outside a restaurant near
OL,13,FMiddlesbrough if they did not hand over
OL,14,Fthe keys to their VW Passat, then sped
OL,15,Faround Teesside in a bid to evade
OL,16,Fpolice.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
