OL,3,GNEWSARobber's danger pursuit after
OL,4,Aknifepoint car theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FJudge Amanda Rippon said the couple
OL,7,Fwere terrified and it was "good
OL,8,Ffortune" no one had been killed by his
OL,9,Fdriving, before referring to the A66
OL,10,Fcrash, which killed seven people
OL,11,Fincluding two police officers in
OL,12,Fsimilar circumstances in August.
OL,14,FLacson, who had previously been jailed
OL,15,Ffor stealing a man's car at knifepoint,
OL,16,Fadmitted robbery and dangerous driving.
